{"type": "root", "attrs": {"type": "node", "context": "sop", "namespace": "apex", "internal": "controlextract", "icon": "SOP/apex-controlextract", "tags": "apex", "since": "20.0", "version": ""}, "body": [{"level": 0, "type": "title", "indent": 0, "text": ["APEX Control Extract"], "extent": [126, 151]}, {"type": "summary", "indent": 0, "text": ["Extracts APEX rig controls to a KineFX skeleton."], "extent": [151, 208]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This node extracts the desired controls (TransformObject nodes) from an APEX rig graph and generates a new APEX graph that is piped into an ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/apex--controlupdateparms", "type": "link", "text": ["APEX Control Update Parms SOP"], "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/apex--controlupdateparms.html"}, ". In the APEX Control Update Parms SOP, the new APEX graph takes in world space transforms and outputs a set of TRS parameters that can be used to run the original rig."], "extent": [208, 583]}, {"type": "fig_group", "body": [{"ext": null, "type": "fig", "indent": 0, "text": [" ", {"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/nodes/sop/apexcontrolextract.png", "type": "img", "text": ""}], "role": "item", "extent": [583, 638], "body": [], "container": true, "attrs": {"display": "full left"}}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This node is normally used together with an APEX Control Update Parms SOP. See the ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/animationworkflow", "type": "link", "text": ["animation workflow"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/animationworkflow.html"}, " for examples of how to use this node."], "extent": [663, 842]}, {"level": 1, "id": "parameters", "container": true, "type": "parameters_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [842, 854], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Extract From Folder"], "extent": [854, 876], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["When turned on, the input APEX graph is unpacked from the path specified in ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Graph Geometry Path"]}, ". This is useful when connecting geometry containing either a full APEX scene or a collection of character elements. See the ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/packedcharacterformat#data-container", "type": "link", "text": ["packed character format"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/packedcharacterformat.html#data-container", "fragment": "#data-container"}, " for more information on the different types of character data containers."], "extent": [904, 1288]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "extractfromfolder"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Graph Geometry Path"], "extent": [1288, 1309], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["When ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Extract From Folder"]}, " is turned on, this is the packed folder path from which to unpack the APEX graph."], "extent": [1332, 1448]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "graphgeopath"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Group"], "extent": [1448, 1455], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/apexpathpattern", "type": "link", "text": ["path pattern"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/apexpathpattern.html"}, " for choosing the controls to extract from the APEX graph."], "extent": [1471, 1587]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "group"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Constraint Input Source"], "extent": [1587, 1612], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Specifies the style of the Control Constraint Graph output."], "extent": [1644, 1709]}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 4, "text": ["Control Skeleton"], "extent": [1709, 1731], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The generated APEX graph (Control Constraint Graph output) takes as input a skeleton with joint names matching those on the Control Skeleton output."], "extent": [1757, 1915]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "controlskel"}}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 4, "text": ["Matrices"], "extent": [1915, 1929], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The generated APEX graph (Control Constraint Graph output) takes in Matrix4 inputs with names corresponding to the control names specified in the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Group"]}, " parameter."], "extent": [1952, 2128]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "matrices"}}], "container": true}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "constraintinputsource"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Layout Nodes"], "extent": [2128, 2142], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["When turned on, performs a basic node layout of the generated APEX graph."], "extent": [2164, 2243]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "layoutnodes"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "text": "Parameters"}, {"level": 1, "id": "inputs", "container": true, "type": "inputs_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [2243, 2251], "body": [{"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Scene/Character/Rig"], "extent": [2251, 2273], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The geometry containing the APEX graph with the controls to extract."], "extent": [2273, 2347]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "text": "Inputs"}, {"level": 1, "id": "outputs", "container": true, "type": "outputs_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [2347, 2356], "body": [{"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Control Constraint Graph"], "extent": [2356, 2383], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["An APEX graph that is ready to be run with the controls' updated world space transforms."], "extent": [2383, 2477]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Control Skeleton"], "extent": [2477, 2495], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["A KineFX skeleton representing the control hierarchy extracted from the input APEX graph."], "extent": [2495, 2590]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "text": "Outputs"}, {"level": 1, "id": "related", "container": true, "type": "related_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [2590, 2599], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/animationworkflow", "type": "link", "text": ["Animation workflow"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/animationworkflow.html"}], "extent": [2599, 2658]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/apexgraphbasics", "type": "link", "text": ["APEX graph basics"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/apexgraphbasics.html"}], "extent": [2658, 2714]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/apexpathpattern", "type": "link", "text": ["APEX path pattern"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/apexpathpattern.html"}], "extent": [2714, 2770]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/packedcharacterformat", "type": "link", "text": ["Packed character format"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/packedcharacterformat.html"}], "extent": [2770, 2838]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/apex--controlupdateparms", "type": "link", "text": "", "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/apex--controlupdateparms.html"}], "extent": [2838, 2876]}], "container": true}], "text": "Related"}], "title": ["APEX Control Extract"], "summary": ["Extracts APEX rig controls to a KineFX skeleton."]}